      <div class="interface-doc-block">
        <h4>Figure 3.79 - 3.85: Admin Return Desk &amp; Inspection Desk</h4>
        <p class="justified-text">
          Illustrates the post-event check-in counter where technicians inspect returned gear. Features the physical condition dropdown selector (Excellent, Good, Fair, Damaged) and return notes field. Selecting "Damaged" automatically flags the asset and prompts creation of a technical maintenance ticket.
