      <h3 class="subsection-title">3.6.3 Entity Relational Diagram (ERD)</h3>
      <p class="justified-text">
        The Entity Relationship Diagram (Figure 3.113) establishes the normalized conceptual schema supporting PinjamGeng. The architecture comprises nine interconnected entities designed to 3rd Normal Form (3NF): <code>users</code>, <code>categories</code>, <code>equipment</code>, <code>packages</code>, <code>package_items</code>, <code>bookings</code>, <code>booking_items</code>, <code>maintenance_tickets</code>, and <code>audit_logs</code>.
      </p>

      <div class="diagram-container" style="text-align:center; margin: 10px 0;">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 920 1150" width="920" height="1150" style="background-color:#ffffff;">
  <style>
    text { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; fill: #000000; }
    .entity-title { font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; text-anchor: middle; fill: #000000; }
    .pk { font-weight: bold; }
    rect { stroke: #000000; stroke-width: 1.5; fill: #ffffff; }
    line { stroke: #000000; stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
    .title-line { stroke: #000000; stroke-width: 1.5; }
    .cardinality { font-size: 9px; font-weight: bold; }
  </style>

  <!-- Outer Boundary -->
  <rect x="15" y="15" width="890" height="1120" />

  <!-- ENTITY 1: categories (Top Left) -->
  <rect x="40" y="50" width="180" height="140" />
  <text x="130" y="70" class="entity-title">categories</text>
  <line x1="40" y1="80" x2="220" y2="80" class="title-line" />
  <text x="50" y="98" class="pk">category_id (PK)</text>
  <text x="50" y="116">category_name</text>
  <text x="50" y="134">description</text>
  <text x="50" y="152">icon</text>
  <text x="50" y="170">created_at</text>

  <!-- ENTITY 2: equipment (Top Middle) -->
  <rect x="360" y="50" width="200" height="260" />
